lace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sxqq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1dc65ae-bb91-49cb-bc7b-b76259b261c6","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"聞いたこともない人じゃなく、詳しい方の論文なのでマジもんの可能性が高い。","ts":"1614864071.105000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"majika","count":5,"users":["UL6CFN8NR","U9S4G0LJW","U7B4ZD49X","U01BY3SDBRS","U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KfZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0808e1e-016b-434e-a117-9148e9d53f17","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"めっちゃ伸びているｗ","ts":"1614863928.103700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T0H4x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0438318c-a747-421f-9adb-8638af85343f","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1367459267444305927?s=20\u003e","ts":"1614863921.103400","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/mattn_jp|@mattn_jp\u003e: RSA暗号解読の件、嫁に話しました。\n途端に泣き崩れる嫁。\nすまんな、もうRSA暗号が安全だと言われる時代じゃないんだ。\n今から子供に「インターネットは終わった」って事を伝えます。\nRSA暗号を使ってる人もいるんです。俺はRSA暗号解読を絶対に許さない。","id":1,"author_name":"mattn","author_subname":"@mattn_jp","author_link":"https://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1367459267444305927","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1361128357698572292/61_qdnll_normal.jpg","text":"RSA暗号解読の件、嫁に話しました。\n途端に泣き崩れる嫁。\nすまんな、もうRSA暗号が安全だと言われる時代じゃないんだ。\n今から子供に「インターネットは終わった」って事を伝えます。\nRSA暗号を使ってる人もいるんです。俺はRSA暗号解読を絶対に許さない。","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1614862670,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1367459267444305927?s=20","original_url":"https://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1367459267444305927?s=20"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KqVCy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"688c1f9a-042c-4454-b0